{"id":"7e70202d5fff2308","group":"58","path":"58/batch17/58-df-relation-composition.md","title":"Composition of Relations","display":"df-relation-composition — Composition of Relations","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-relation-composition","aliases":["58-df-relation-composition"],"display":"df-relation-composition — Composition of Relations","depends_on":["[[../batch18/58-df-relation.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-relation-composition"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-relation-composition</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-relation-composition — Composition of Relations"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"7ccfc8c88f29968a\" href=\"?note=7ccfc8c88f29968a\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-relation.md\">../batch18/58-df-relation.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B,C,R,S\\in V\">\\(A,B,C,R,S\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rel}_S(R,A,B)\">\\(\\mathrm{Rel}_S(R,A,B)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rel}_S(S,B,C)\">\\(\\mathrm{Rel}_S(S,B,C)\\)</span>（关系谓词，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"7ccfc8c88f29968a\" href=\"?note=7ccfc8c88f29968a\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-relation.md\">../batch18/58-df-relation.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\circ R\">\\(S\\circ R\\)</span>（先沿 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span>、再沿 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 的关系复合）</li>\n<li>有序对采用知识库的规范编码</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}relation\\text{-}composition} \\vdash \\mathrm{Rel}_S(R,A,B)\\land\\mathrm{Rel}_S(S,B,C)\\to S\\circ R\\coloneqq\\{\\langle a,c\\rangle\\in A\\times C:\\exists b\\in B\\;(\\langle a,b\\rangle\\in R\\land\\langle b,c\\rangle\\in S)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}relation\\text{-}composition} \\vdash \\mathrm{Rel}_S(R,A,B)\\land\\mathrm{Rel}_S(S,B,C)\\to S\\circ R\\coloneqq\\{\\langle a,c\\rangle\\in A\\times C:\\exists b\\in B\\;(\\langle a,b\\rangle\\in R\\land\\langle b,c\\rangle\\in S)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Symbol\">[Symbol]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S \\circ R\">\\(S \\circ R\\)</span>: the composition of relations <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span>, where <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(a, c) \\in S \\circ R\">\\((a, c) \\in S \\circ R\\)</span> iff there exists <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b \\in B\">\\(b \\in B\\)</span> such that <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(a, b) \\in R\">\\((a, b) \\in R\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(b, c) \\in S\">\\((b, c) \\in S\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{dom}\">\\(\\mathrm{dom}\\)</span> (定义域, 集合论标准符号)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ran}\">\\(\\mathrm{ran}\\)</span> (值域, 集合论标准符号)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>复合运算满足以下性质：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>结合律</strong>：若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R:A\\rel B\">\\(R:A\\rel B\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S:B\\rel C\">\\(S:B\\rel C\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T:C\\rel D\">\\(T:C\\rel D\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(T\\circ S)\\circ R=T\\circ(S\\circ R)\">\\((T\\circ S)\\circ R=T\\circ(S\\circ R)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><strong>定义域</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{dom}(S\\circ R)=\\{a\\in A:\\exists b\\in\\operatorname{dom}(S)\\;(\\langle a,b\\rangle\\in R)\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{dom}(S\\circ R)=\\{a\\in A:\\exists b\\in\\operatorname{dom}(S)\\;(\\langle a,b\\rangle\\in R)\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><strong>值域</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ran}(S\\circ R)=\\{c\\in C:\\exists b\\in\\operatorname{ran}(R)\\;(\\langle b,c\\rangle\\in S)\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{ran}(S\\circ R)=\\{c\\in C:\\exists b\\in\\operatorname{ran}(R)\\;(\\langle b,c\\rangle\\in S)\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 是相应函数的图像时，该关系复合正是通常函数复合的图像。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Symbol","text":"[Symbol]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch18/58-df-relation.md","status":"resolved","id":"7ccfc8c88f29968a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-relation.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-relation.md","status":"resolved","id":"7ccfc8c88f29968a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Rel}_S(R,A,B)$ 与 $\\mathrm{Rel}_S(S,B,C)$（关系谓词，见 [[../batch18/58-df-relation.md]]）","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A,B,C,R,S\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Rel}_S(R,A,B)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Rel}_S(S,B,C)","display":false},{"tex":"S\\circ R","display":false},{"tex":"R","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}relation\\text{-}composition} \\vdash \\mathrm{Rel}_S(R,A,B)\\land\\mathrm{Rel}_S(S,B,C)\\to S\\circ R\\coloneqq\\{\\langle a,c\\rangle\\in A\\times C:\\exists b\\in B\\;(\\langle a,b\\rangle\\in R\\land\\langle b,c\\rangle\\in S)\\}","display":true},{"tex":"S \\circ R","display":false},{"tex":"R","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"(a, c) \\in S \\circ R","display":false},{"tex":"b \\in B","display":false},{"tex":"(a, b) \\in R","display":false},{"tex":"(b, c) \\in S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{dom}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ran}","display":false},{"tex":"R:A\\rel B","display":false},{"tex":"S:B\\rel C","display":false},{"tex":"T:C\\rel D","display":false},{"tex":"(T\\circ S)\\circ R=T\\circ(S\\circ R)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{dom}(S\\circ R)=\\{a\\in A:\\exists b\\in\\operatorname{dom}(S)\\;(\\langle a,b\\rangle\\in R)\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ran}(S\\circ R)=\\{c\\in C:\\exists b\\in\\operatorname{ran}(R)\\;(\\langle b,c\\rangle\\in S)\\}","display":false},{"tex":"R","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false}],"bytes":1583,"backlinks":[{"id":"b653ee0494f3a15d","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Rel}_S(R,A,B)$ and $\\mathrm{Rel}_S(S,B,C)$ are typed relations, and $S\\circ R$ is their composition (see [[../batch17/58-df-relation-composition.md]], [[../batch18/58-df-relation.md]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1067","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-relation-composition.md|58-df-relation-composition]]（batch17）"},{"id":"b4de3484ad8d9669","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\theta\\circ\\phi=\\{\\langle a,c\\rangle:\\exists b\\;(\\langle a,b\\rangle\\in\\phi\\land\\langle b,c\\rangle\\in\\theta)\\}$ is relation composition from [[58-df-relation-composition]]."}],"outgoing":["7ccfc8c88f29968a"]}